  "description": "Fuaran.Compute.Regression — regression modelling over the pinned matrix operations of Fuaran.Compute.LinearAlgebra, every answer byte-identical on .NET, under Fable and in every host that ports it: least squares by a streaming Givens QR whose O(p²) state survives a restart through its wire codec, the solve with D49's rank rule and aliased columns, classical and heteroskedasticity-consistent (HC0 to HC3) standard errors, and generalised linear models by IRLS over the pinned elementary functions of Fuaran.Compute.Elementary with the same bits and iteration count on every host — the Gaussian, Poisson, Gamma, quasi-Poisson, Tweedie, binomial, quasi-binomial, inverse Gaussian and negative binomial families under the whole link set. Typed errors and canonical NaN out. No fused multiply-add and no host mathematics call on any host. Fable-clean.",
